  "versionCode": 100,
  "versionName": "3.1.7-pre2",
  "notes": "Bannerlator 3.1.7-pre2: every setting edited inside the Deck style (no Classic screens), the XMB view full screen, Open with Bannerlator for any .exe, no clipboard notice when Wayland games start.",
  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Every setting in Deck",
      "text": "DXVK/VKD3D, Wayland, drives, audio, ReShade, env vars and the Linux runtime are all edited inside the Deck style."
    },
    {
      "title": "XMB full screen",
      "text": "The XMB is a Shelf library view again, full screen, with a game's settings in its own columns."
    },
    {
      "title": "Open with Bannerlator",
      "text": "Run a Windows .exe straight from your file manager, once or from your library."
    },
    {
      "title": "No clipboard notice",
      "text": "Wayland games read your clipboard only when you paste, so Android no longer pops up a notice at every start."
    }
  ],
